cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this Windows port, please cite the upstream Flye paper(s) AND this
  repository. See the "Citing" section of the README.
title: "Flye for Windows (native port)"
abstract: >-
  A native-Windows build of the Flye long-read genome assembler (Oxford Nanopore /
  PacBio), with its C++ core and bundled minimap2 / samtools compiled to run
  natively on Windows without WSL, Docker, Cygwin or a Linux VM.
